      "question": "All outerwear made by Arctic Hare is designed to withstand ---- cold temperatures.",
      "choices": [
        "generously",
        "famously",
        "extremely",
        "suspiciously"
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "topic": "程度副词",
      "keywords": "extremely cold adverb",
      "answer_explain": "空格修饰 cold，extremely 表示极其，extremely cold temperatures 即极低的气温。generously 表慷慨地，famously 表出名地，suspiciously 表可疑地，均不表达这里所需的寒冷程度。",
      "question_type": "词汇题",
      "choice_translations": [
        "慷慨地；大方地",
